WEBVTT

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:01.560
You don't have to worry about him.

00:02:01.910 --> 00:02:02.870
Come on, let's kill the bottom.

00:02:11.260 --> 00:02:12.240
My father spoke the door.

00:02:13.210 --> 00:02:14.450
We must be careful they don't see us.

00:02:16.050 --> 00:02:16.590
chance of that.

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:20.280
I'll have you shut off the motor and let the tide carry us in.

00:02:21.270 --> 00:02:22.470
I could only get a boy.

00:02:23.260 --> 00:02:25.060
I'm going to use a vanishing ray in Prince Stanley.

00:02:25.360 --> 00:02:25.760
Yes.

00:02:26.840 --> 00:02:29.360
And I've brought the death ray in case they start.

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:01.770
Thank you.

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:02.660
Glory!

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:10.280
How'd you get here?

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:12.020
With Professor Van Dorn in a motorboat.

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:12.460
Oh, fine.

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:12.840
Well, come on.

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:13.740
We've got to get out of here quick.

00:04:24.550 --> 00:04:25.390
Down the way quick, Professor.

00:04:25.590 --> 00:04:26.310
The ship's on fire.

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:27.970
It's full of liquor and liable to blow up any minute.

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:40.890
Hey, Stroud, the boat's on fire.

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:41.720
Come on.

00:04:42.580 --> 00:04:42.960
Wake up.

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:44.080
Get out of here.

00:04:44.730 --> 00:04:46.520
Hey, Stanfield is in the hole.

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:47.380
Right.

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:48.230
He is.

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:49.010
We got to get him out.

00:04:49.130 --> 00:04:49.270
Wait.

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:50.220
Come on.

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:28.270
Did you stop?

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:29.980
I was there, didn't I?

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:33.140
McDonald, I just escaped from an old schooner where I've been held prisoner.

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:38.080
That was a plot to keep you from a meeting of the stockholders.

00:05:38.840 --> 00:05:39.700
Yes, I think it was.

00:05:40.870 --> 00:05:43.990
But thanks to Gloria and Professor Van Dorn, it failed.

00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:54.060
We got Stanfield safe on board the Dolphin.

00:05:54.340 --> 00:05:54.640
Good.

00:05:55.070 --> 00:05:55.590
Keep him there.

00:05:56.300 --> 00:05:58.000
McDonald can't do a thing without Stanfield.

00:05:58.500 --> 00:05:59.980
And with Stanfield Tribune...

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.080
stock in my possession, which you will see

00:06:02.080 --> 00:06:04.600
as transferred to me, Cadwell, I shall

00:06:04.600 --> 00:06:06.160
have absolute control.

00:06:06.590 --> 00:06:09.330
Yeah, sounds all right, but it would be

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:11.250
a lot better if you had a proxy to vote

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:13.450
Stanfield's stock. Then you couldn't lose.

00:06:13.880 --> 00:06:15.920
You couldn't get Stanfield to sign a proxy

00:06:15.920 --> 00:06:17.620
to me in a million years. I know that.

00:06:18.010 --> 00:06:20.610
I'd take care of it myself. All you'd have to

00:06:20.610 --> 00:06:22.770
do would be sure that Stanfield didn't escape.

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:24.870
Stanfield won't get away from us this time,

00:06:25.010 --> 00:06:27.080
Cadwell. I left Kent and Stroud

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:28.640
on board the boat to make sure of that.

00:06:30.480 --> 00:06:31.540
Kidd, Stroud.

00:06:31.930 --> 00:06:33.320
What do you fellas do?

00:06:33.440 --> 00:06:35.020
That's about how sure I could be.

00:06:35.300 --> 00:06:37.860
Thought I told you to stay on board that boat and guard Stanfield.

00:06:38.020 --> 00:06:39.220
That's what we were doing, but...

00:06:39.220 --> 00:06:41.040
Never mind the buts, where's Stanfield?

00:06:41.340 --> 00:06:41.580
Dead.

00:06:42.020 --> 00:06:42.240
What?

00:06:43.320 --> 00:06:44.840
Fire broke out below.

00:06:45.850 --> 00:06:48.680
When Stroud and I discovered it, the place was a blazing furnace.

00:06:49.460 --> 00:06:50.400
We couldn't get near him.

00:06:51.900 --> 00:06:52.860
Stanfield, dead?

00:06:56.340 --> 00:06:57.100
Get out, all of you.

00:06:58.700 --> 00:06:59.280
I want to think.

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:17.740
If Stanfield is dead, an outright sale of his stock to you bearing his signature would be much better than a proxy.

00:07:26.400 --> 00:07:29.480
From now on, there's going to be no halfway measures in dealing with Barnett.

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:29.980
What do you mean?

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:30.740
Just this.

00:07:31.370 --> 00:07:35.320
I pool my stock with yours in order to keep Barnett from getting control of the Tribune.

00:07:35.700 --> 00:07:37.700
I've been willing to let you handle this your own way.

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:41.810
But when his men force their way into my office and threaten me,

00:07:42.330 --> 00:07:44.090
get away with your stock at the point of the gun,

00:07:44.700 --> 00:07:47.180
it's time to put the matter in the hands of the proper authorities.

00:07:47.430 --> 00:07:48.390
You mean notify the police?

00:07:48.430 --> 00:07:48.790
Exactly.

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:50.400
And I'm going to do it right now.

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:52.280
Please, Mr. McDonald, don't do that.

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:53.700
I'm sorry, Gloria.

00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:58.780
It's the only way to recover our property and stop Barnett's everlasting plotting.

00:07:59.470 --> 00:07:59.970
But how do we...

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.000
no father has his doctor. Dorgan may

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:03.720
still have it. I don't think that's likely.

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:06.920
Just give me one more chance. I'll go

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:09.300
to my father and find out. And if she fails

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:11.160
to learn anything, it's time enough to notify

00:08:11.160 --> 00:08:21.090
the police. Thanks.

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:01.440
Is Mr. Barnett in?

00:09:02.140 --> 00:09:02.720
Yes, miss.

00:09:02.840 --> 00:09:03.780
I'll tell him you're here.

00:09:11.420 --> 00:09:13.960
The young lady is here again, sir.

00:09:14.180 --> 00:09:14.620
Just a minute.

00:09:15.430 --> 00:09:16.990
Let's get these Stanford ones back in the safe.

00:09:31.180 --> 00:09:37.340
All right, let her come in.

00:09:41.150 --> 00:09:42.570
Will you step inside, miss, please?

00:09:46.390 --> 00:09:47.650
Gloria, come on, sit down.

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:50.360
What's on your mind?

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:54.380
Come to make one last appeal

00:09:54.380 --> 00:09:57.660
in an effort to save you from the consequences of your own actions.

00:09:58.570 --> 00:09:59.970
Father, if you attempt to vote the trib...

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:02.940
If you can stop the Dorgan stove for Mr. Stanfield, you'll be arrested.

00:10:03.850 --> 00:10:06.770
My dear child, you'll need to see alarm.

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:10.210
I've had too much experience to be frightened by idle threats.

00:10:10.390 --> 00:10:13.850
I happen to know that unless the stock is returned, the police will be notified.

00:10:15.070 --> 00:10:20.110
And Dorgan and the others will involve you when they find themselves faced with a charge of attempted murder.

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:25.130
Attempted murder? What do you mean?

00:10:25.780 --> 00:10:28.580
Your men imprisoned Mr. Stanfield in the hole of the dolphin.

00:10:28.820 --> 00:10:29.960
Your boat found him...

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:34.310
securely and left him there to die when they're both caught on fire. How do you know all this?

00:10:34.950 --> 00:10:42.770
I helped him to escape. Stanfield escaped? Oh, and he sent you

00:10:42.770 --> 00:10:47.230
here to try to frighten me into giving up the stock, huh? Sent you because he was afraid to come

00:10:47.230 --> 00:10:51.730
himself. Well, you tell Mr. Stanfield for me that I'm going to get

00:10:51.730 --> 00:10:56.120
control of the Tribune and silence its pages in spite of all of you.

00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:59.970
You'll never get control of the Tribune with that stolen stock. I won't, huh? It isn't...

00:11:00.030 --> 00:11:06.300
that you should have it you know it yeah we'll see about that yes we will i hope before it's too late

00:11:06.300 --> 00:11:20.670
i shall fight to save you father in spite of yourself denny send organ up here right away for

00:11:29.170 --> 00:11:29.890
heaven's sake stand

00:11:30.030 --> 00:11:32.170
Please stop pacing the floor and sit down.

00:11:32.350 --> 00:11:32.990
Oh, I can't.

00:11:33.110 --> 00:11:33.810
Wait about Gloria.

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:35.660
I ought to have heard from her before this.

00:11:36.270 --> 00:11:37.470
Gloria will be all right.

00:11:38.220 --> 00:11:39.100
Well, that's her father.

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:40.770
He surely won't harm her.

00:11:41.860 --> 00:11:42.080
Here.

00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:44.800
I'll show you something to take your mind off this.

00:11:46.310 --> 00:11:47.770
Something you've never seen before.

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:54.120
Eh?

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:55.300
Take a look at it.

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:04.880
Move it a little to the right.

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:14.890
They must weigh a ton.

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:15.900
He does.

00:12:16.140 --> 00:12:16.460
Eh?

00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:22.110
Exactly.

00:12:22.210 --> 00:12:23.850
A mechanical man.

00:12:23.990 --> 00:12:25.300
Now watch.

00:12:30.570 --> 00:12:32.950
This control is a shortwave radio current.

00:12:33.960 --> 00:12:35.860
Anyone who knows how can operate it.

00:12:36.420 --> 00:12:38.240
This robot can do almost anything.

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:39.340
Watch.

00:13:22.870 --> 00:13:23.190
thought.

00:13:24.540 --> 00:13:25.980
What can he do to a human being?

00:13:27.100 --> 00:13:28.600
Rush him to mincemeat.

00:13:45.740 --> 00:13:45.980
Bye-bye.

00:13:47.050 --> 00:13:50.230
But tell me, why are you always inventing things like this of a...

00:13:50.540 --> 00:13:51.780
Of a destructive nature.

00:13:52.650 --> 00:13:55.010
The robot can serve many useful purposes.

00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:56.830
as well as deadly ones.

00:13:57.540 --> 00:13:58.380
As I suppose so.

00:13:59.270 --> 00:13:59.970
There is a control.

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:02.140
perfected so that it's absolutely foolproof?

00:14:02.680 --> 00:14:05.740
I don't know, Sam. I haven't dared

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:07.930
risk it to that extent. That's why I

00:14:07.930 --> 00:14:09.810
built this secret closet and always keep the

00:14:09.810 --> 00:14:14.020
control box locked up. Suppose something went

00:14:14.020 --> 00:14:16.600
wrong with the control. That robot

00:14:16.600 --> 00:14:18.880
would crash its way through brick walls

00:14:18.880 --> 00:14:20.820
and crush every obstacle

00:14:20.820 --> 00:14:23.860
in its path. Nothing could stop it.

00:14:26.990 --> 00:14:29.960
Now, before to take any chance,

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:30.320
answers.

00:14:30.890 --> 00:14:31.190
look

00:14:40.740 --> 00:14:41.520
Yes, that's what it is.

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:42.730
Open the gate.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:00.780
I'm glad you're here.

00:15:00.980 --> 00:15:01.540
Well, you're over here.

00:15:02.010 --> 00:15:02.950
Did you get what you went after?

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:04.420
Stand this tribune, stop.

00:15:05.040 --> 00:15:07.000
No, but I found out where it is.

00:15:07.140 --> 00:15:07.320
Where?

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:09.060
I'll tell you.

00:15:09.370 --> 00:15:11.530
Because I don't want father to do something I know he'll regret.

00:15:12.440 --> 00:15:13.600
You'll find it in a safe.

00:15:13.790 --> 00:15:14.730
in father's office.

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:17.360
Hidden by a secret panel behind a picture on the wall.

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:17.660
Good.

00:15:18.140 --> 00:15:19.440
We'll go there tonight and get it.

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:19.920
Now, wait a minute.

00:15:20.660 --> 00:15:23.600
I'm perfectly justified in going after it in any way that I see fit,

00:15:23.720 --> 00:15:24.620
because it's rightfully mine.

00:15:25.050 --> 00:15:27.010
But I don't intend that either of you shall get mixed up in it.

00:15:27.090 --> 00:15:27.370
But, David...

00:15:27.370 --> 00:15:27.990
I don't argue.

00:15:28.350 --> 00:15:28.910
Perfectly simple.

00:15:29.010 --> 00:15:29.930
I wear the vanishing ray.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:31.280
the professor's electric torch.

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:05.600
Did you get it, Stanley?

00:17:05.760 --> 00:17:08.280
Yep, and your father won't learn the sad news until he goes to open the safe.

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:09.040
Did you have any trouble?

00:17:09.300 --> 00:17:11.840
No, the janitor was cleaning up, so I had to use the vanishing ray.

00:17:12.080 --> 00:17:13.440
Your electric torch did the rest.

00:17:13.540 --> 00:17:13.720
Good.

00:17:14.170 --> 00:17:16.330
We'll hurry back to the beach house and no one will be the wiser.

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:32.000
Now keep quiet till I get this gate unlocked.

00:17:37.480 --> 00:17:40.420
It's as much as your life is worth to touch anything of Van Dorn's.

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:42.860
He's got that gate charged with electricity.

00:17:43.240 --> 00:17:45.180
Well, maybe we'd better wait outside till they come back.

00:17:45.300 --> 00:17:45.620
No.

00:17:46.150 --> 00:17:48.170
We'll go over the wall and trap him from the inside.

00:17:48.650 --> 00:17:50.030
Get the rope with the hook out of the car.

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:50.920
Step on it.

00:17:50.980 --> 00:17:51.780
Do you want to be here all night?

00:17:55.080 --> 00:17:55.440
Hurt you?

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:09.540
Give me your foot.

00:18:10.470 --> 00:18:11.330
Come on, Dodon.

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:11.850
Let's lift him up.

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:14.490
Hang on.

00:18:18.630 --> 00:18:19.410
Pull the other guy over.

00:18:30.660 --> 00:18:31.540
Don't get out, Stan.

00:18:32.140 --> 00:18:33.400
I'll use the electrical key.

00:18:54.500 --> 00:18:55.200
Here they come, Dorgan.

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:56.740
Do we grab them now?

00:18:57.480 --> 00:18:59.500
Now wait till they open the door and get inside.

00:19:17.820 --> 00:19:19.640
Tribune stock away where it'll be safe.
